      "content": "i don't want a new community. i don't want to \"find resonance\" with anyone else. that's just more pretending. i just keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i could just... stop. if the ghost just finally disappeared instead of dragging this body around. i feel like i'm just haunting my own life. wouldn't it be more honest to just let the end come since the person everyone knew is already gone?",
